    "notes": "Open JSON REST API returning an array of company objects. Query by $filter=Business_Accounting_NO eq <8-digit 統一編號> (URL-encode spaces with %20). The Company_Name `like` filter is unreliable (empty body observed) — for bulk-by-name use GCIS downloadable dataset files instead. Dates are ROC/Minguo YYYMMDD (calendar year = ROC year + 1911) — convert. Currency TWD. Redact Responsible_Name (personal data, PDPA)."
